{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226520","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226520","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1222652001:1":{"text":"Come on, don't doubt me! I would never lie!","source_cn":"哎呀~不要怀疑人家啦！人家是绝对不会说谎的哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB16E83E3B44DF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222652002:1":{"text":"She's kinda cute for a criminal, even with her pale skin.","source_cn":"那个通缉犯虽然有着惨白的皮肤，但长相还蛮可爱嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22FD8F588897AF69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222652003:1":{"text":"Where'd you see her?","source_cn":"你是在哪里见到她的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788411DCB41D72F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222652004:1":{"text":"I go out of the city to pick flowers every day. This morning, I saw her near the woods, just outside the southern gate.","source_cn":"人家每天都会出城采花，今天大清早，我在南门外的树林里看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x248BD2D0465C3CA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222652005:1":{"text":"Now, I'm not really interested in the bounty—too much work. But do you think Miss Sonja could stop by my flower shop sometime? ","source_cn":"人家不想要什么赏金，可不可以请索尼娅小姐来人家的花店坐坐呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE54FA3AA7A450A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222652006:1":{"text":"I mean, a little endorsement and good publicity wouldn't hurt, right?","source_cn":"比起一时的利益，人家更想要能用来宣传的噱头嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7637BDD8C4371B91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222652007:1":{"text":"Such an enthusiastic girl... and a sharp business sense too. She and Rowan would definitely get along.","source_cn":"真是热情的女孩子……而且很有商业头脑，罗万和她肯定会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDE02D2FC602D8B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222652008:1":{"text":"How much more proof do you need? I really saw her with my own eyes.","source_cn":"还要怎么确认嘛，人家真的亲眼看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FA33FB192ABBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1222652008":{"text":"How much more proof do you need? I really saw her with my own eyes.","source_cn":"还要怎么确认嘛，人家真的亲眼看到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FA33FB192ABBD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222652009:1":{"text":"Of course! Isn't there a sketch on the wanted poster?","source_cn":"通缉令上不都画着……况且，我也亲眼看到了啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B690A8022AE3E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222652011:1":{"text":"I go to that forest often. The flowers there are beautiful, a lucky spot for sure.","source_cn":"人家经常去那片树林，那里的花格外鲜艳，看来那里是个幸运...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8317F8D6A8C36B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1222652011":{"text":"I go to that forest often. The flowers there are beautiful, a lucky spot for sure.","source_cn":"人家经常去那片树林，那里的花格外鲜艳，看来那里是个幸运场所呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8317F8D6A8C36B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222652012:1":{"text":"W-well, you're not a florist, so you wouldn't know!","source_cn":"这、这个，您不是卖花的人，不懂的啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC05FB5B9845DB129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222652016:1":{"text":"I saw her silhouette, and I was just about to get closer, but she disappeared in a flash!","source_cn":"当时，我看见她的身影，正想走近一点，结果她立马就消失了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE2CD2B72C306DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1222652016":{"text":"I saw her silhouette, and I was just about to get closer, but she disappeared in a flash!","source_cn":"当时，我看见她的身影，正想走近一点，结果她立马就消失了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFE2CD2B72C306DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222652017:1":{"text":"Oh, are you worried about me? Thanks! But I'm a brave girl, I wouldn't be scared of a Graveborn!","source_cn":"咦？你在关心人家吗？谢谢！人家是个勇敢的女孩子，亡灵什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EC3849683FFC93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"You weren't scared?","source_cn":"你怎么敢接近亡灵？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2ED9AD11BDDE5DBD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You weren't scared?","female":"You weren't scared?","variant_male_record_index":"67462","variant_female_record_index":"67463","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222652018:1":{"text":"Like a bubble—poof! She was gone in an instant.","source_cn":"像泡沫那样，噗！一下就没了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA415973DACA05FCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222652019:1":{"text":"Hmm... that sounds a bit suspicious. Did you really see her?","source_cn":"嗯……你真的看见了吗？听上去不太像真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1009AF4C8D4BA22B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1222652019":{"text":"Hmm... that sounds a bit suspicious. Did you really see her?","source_cn":"嗯……你真的看见了吗？听上去不太像真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1009AF4C8D4BA22B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222652020:1":{"text":"Jeez, no need to be so harsh! Sorry, I was lying, I just... really wanted to meet Sonja...","source_cn":"哇呀！好凶哦……对不起嘛，人家只是想见见索尼娅小姐而已……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16964220D0204D46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"Did you really see the criminal?!","source_cn":"你到底有没有看见通缉犯？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x430ADBA41740851D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Did you really see the criminal?!","female":"Did you really see the criminal?!","variant_male_record_index":"67466","variant_female_record_index":"67467","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"How did she disappear?","source_cn":"她怎么消失的？说说","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCB6926945430F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How did she disappear?","female":"How did she disappear?","variant_male_record_index":"67464","variant_female_record_index":"67465","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"Is there really a place like that?","source_cn":"我不记得树林里有花田","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x951465CE3F8AC1D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Is there really a place like that?","female":"Is there really a place like that?","variant_male_record_index":"67458","variant_female_record_index":"67459","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222652013:1":{"text":"Yes, every day!","source_cn":"对呀，每天都去哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE50F98877BC7E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222652014:1":{"text":"What about when the weather's bad, like if it's storming?","source_cn":"暴风雨的时候呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8AA616D2FA91BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222652015:1":{"text":"Uh, well... Let's not talk about exceptions like that...","source_cn":"这种例外就不要提了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60FA52F1900AD976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"You go there every day?","source_cn":"你每天都去？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC8C8047F21655C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You go there every day?","female":"You go there every day?","variant_male_record_index":"67460","variant_female_record_index":"67461","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"You're sure it was a girl?","source_cn":"你确定那是女孩子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B3FE5DAF479A70E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're sure it was a girl?","female":"You're sure it was a girl?","variant_male_record_index":"67454","variant_female_record_index":"67455","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222652010:1":{"text":"Yes, it was broad daylight. I was picking flowers and saw her clear as day.","source_cn":"我采花的时候已经天亮了，看得很清楚呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74C37F1DAEC3BF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"\"With your own eyes\"?","source_cn":"亲眼看到？你确定？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x180D7BE44B423754","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"\"With your own eyes\"?","female":"\"With your own eyes\"?","variant_male_record_index":"67456","variant_female_record_index":"67457","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卖花女格妮":{"text":"Flower Girl Jen","source":"卖花女格妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":3}}